      "q": "How much does AmerisourceBergen Drug make from federal contracts?",
      "a": "AmerisourceBergen Drug obligated $5B from federal contracts in FY2026 to date. AmerisourceBergen Drug won 320,232 awards this period, with an average award size of $15.7K, and obligations are down 32.5% year over year. Historical obligations were $2.1B in FY21, $2B in FY22, $4.4B in FY23, $6.1B in FY24, and $7.4B in FY25."
